### CST8919 Lab 2 - test-app.http
### Requires the "REST Client" VS Code extension.
### Replace <your-app-name> with your deployed Web App name.

@host = https://<your-app-name>.azurewebsites.net

### 1. Health check (should return 200 ok)
GET {{host}}/

### 2. Successful login (logs LOGIN_SUCCESS)
POST {{host}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "P@ssw0rd123"
}

### 3. Single failed login (logs LOGIN_FAILED)
POST {{host}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "wrong-password"
}

### --------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. Brute-force simulation.
### Click "Send Request" on EACH of the blocks below (6 failures > the
### threshold of 5). Faster alternative: use the curl loop in the README.
### --------------------------------------------------------------------

